Every final land comparison's verdict is hardcoded to `regressed` (~930). When the primary check fails ordinarily and its targeted retry hits a confinement failure, the shared classifier never sees the `confinement_error` verdict it needs (src/gates/failure-class.ts ~70). The observation becomes `regression / retry_failed`, although D0a requires `confinement`. Landing still blocks; the recorded class is wrong.
Derive the verdict from the effective retry result. Reproduced by the added land-queue regression.

Scope: the change is 260 source lines against the spec's ~115 (stop at 155). Keep this round to these three fixes and report the final count.

Regressions (all fail at HEAD), for test/pipeline-gates.test.ts and test/land-queue.test.ts:
